    <tr><td>DF-05.1</td><td>L1</td><td>DF-05.1 Discovery Request / fromOrigins</td><td>PO-03</td><td>PO-01.2</td><td>Macro getTools() request from an author-provided agent running as script in the caller document or iframe, carrying optional origin filtering; validation and iteration are defined by the referenced getTools() algorithm.</td><td><a href="https://webmachinelearning.github.io/webmcp/#dom-modelcontext-gettools">WebMCP — getTools()</a> [[WEBMCP]]</td></tr>
